<title>FRANCE: One flour ship expected in Rouen by September 16.</title>
<headline>One flour ship expected in Rouen by September 16.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>One ship is expected in Rouen by September 16 to load around 1,700 tonnes of flour, port officials said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The destination was not specified.</p>
<p>--Paris newsroom +33 1 4221 5432</p>
